EADME + source honesty label) never re-derived after the sibling shipped. No founder row owns this status claim (board owner search over 'logsey export contract' / 'export subcommand' returns only unrelated closed rows LORE-005/LORE-020/LORE-045 — different mechanisms).\n\nFIX: update README.md:404-405, lore/evidence.py:10-19 and LOGSEY_EXPORT_CONTRACT_STATUS to the shipped reality: name the landing commits/date and state exactly what the shipped help asserts; decide and record whether the wire format is FROZEN by comparing the observed block header (\"## logsey evidence block\") against parse_logsey_export's accepted shapes — do NOT claim a freeze without verifying logsey's own docs; if still unfrozen, say \"shipped <date>, format observed <date>, still unfrozen\" instead of \"unimplemented\" and keep the honesty law intact.\n\nACCEPTANCE (falsifiable):\n1. grep -c 'subcommand is unimplemented' README.md -> 0\n2. grep -c 'not yet implemented' lore/evidence.py -> 0\n3. lore/evidence.py docstring names the landing date/commits (>=1 of '2026-10-22', '43e2e55', 'LOGSEY-104') and states the frozen/unfrozen verdict on the observed format\n4. README.md and docs/INSTALL.md:408 still resolve the contract pointer to lore/evidence.py\n5. bash scripts/check-test-count.sh PASS and uv run pytest -q still 586 passed after the edit\n\nEVIDENCE ARTIFACT (frozen at audit time, sha256 f7d2040f66bd3b40efb8de6c9d1823da94a1f98f22095270454beb1a79ad50e6): docs/qa/evidence/run-DOC-audit-20261124-2103/README.md\n\nch:trace row=DOC-13 spec=README.md#shipped--runs-today-verified-on-main wave=none:serial-docs-tick test=none:no-arm-guards-sibling-contract-status doc=README.md prompt=none:tick-prompt-not-persisted evidence=docs/qa/evidence/run-DOC-audit-20261124-2103/README.md witness=none:repo-local-doc-claims-no-external-endpoint verdict=none:open-finding commit=none:open memory=none:not-written","acceptance_criteria":"grep -c 'for as long as' README.md -> 0 (criterion token corrected 2026-11-